{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act43side_level_act43side_03_beg","storyGroup":"act43side","storySort":6,"storyDependence":"act43side_level_act43side_02_end","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"AD-3","storyName":"戏剧性","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"蒂比盘问最后见到谢莉的男主演迈克尔，认为他具有作案嫌疑；与此同时，八卦摄影助理正在探寻卢西恩身上的秘密，却意外得知了拍摄地块即将遭遇天灾的重磅消息。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act43side/level_act43side_03_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act43side_03","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":4,"next":6,"characters":["蒂比","迈克尔","玛丽昂","摄影助理","倒霉的场工","？？？","卢西恩","莫伊拉"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":4},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ec/Avg_bg_62_g9_outsidestudio_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":5},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":6},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":7},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$drift_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_drift_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":8,"musicid":0},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#9$1","duration":"1","id":9},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":10},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"……谢莉小姐死了。","id":11,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/97/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":12},{"type":"dialog","id":13},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1839_1#3$1","duration":"1","id":14},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#3$1","duration":"1","id":15},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":16},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":17},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"怎么会？","id":18,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/04/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1839_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":19},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛丽昂","text":"先是道尔顿，再是谢莉……我的天，这到底是怎么一回事？","id":20,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a6/Avg_avg_npc_1839_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":21},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#5$1","id":22},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"我说，谢莉小姐死了。","id":23,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":24},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1839_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":25},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":26},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛丽昂","text":"你这是什么语气？","id":27,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5d/Avg_avg_npc_1839_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛丽昂","text":"谢谢你专程来拦住我和迈克尔，通知我们剧组又出了意外，我们也很震惊。","id":28,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5d/Avg_avg_npc_1839_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":29},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#5$1","id":30},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"谢莉小姐死前见到的最后一个人，是迈克尔先生。","id":31,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":32},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":33},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1839_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":34},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"……","id":35,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1839_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":36},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛丽昂","text":"你不要血口喷人，小蒂比。","id":37,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a2/Avg_avg_npc_1839_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛丽昂","text":"谢莉昨天明明参加了你的观影会，和你还有莫伊拉待在一起，我都听说了。","id":38,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a2/Avg_avg_npc_1839_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":39},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#9$1","id":40},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"正因为昨晚谢莉小姐是和我们在一起，正因为她中途收到了一条讯息离开，我和莫丽没有多问，也没有陪她，后来出了那样的事情……","id":41,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/97/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#5$1","id":42},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"所以我和莫丽才必须调查清楚到底发生了什么，我走访了很多人——","id":43,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#6$1","id":44},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"有工作人员看到了，她在离那个仓库不远的摄影棚和你会面了！","id":45,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":46},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":47},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1839_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":48},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"我们只是偶遇！","id":49,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/47/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"我看她一副魂不守舍的样子，以为她还在为中断拍摄的事愧疚，想安慰安慰她。","id":50,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/47/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":51},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"唉，没想到她真会想不开。","id":52,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e7/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1839_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":53},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛丽昂","text":"安慰，摄影棚，就你们两个？","id":54,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a2/Avg_avg_npc_1839_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":55},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"宝贝儿，相信我。我心里只有你一个。","id":56,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/04/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1839_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":57},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛丽昂","text":"闭嘴！","id":58,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a2/Avg_avg_npc_1839_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1839_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":59},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛丽昂","text":"所以，真的是你杀了谢莉？","id":60,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_npc_1839_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":61},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":62},{"type":"charslot","id":63},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":64},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d0/Avg_bg_bg_warehouse.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":65},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":66},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":67},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":68},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":69},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影助理","text":"才几天，已经发生两起意外了？","id":70,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1846_1#2$1","id":71},{"type":"dialogue","name":"倒霉的场工","text":"而且都闹出了人命。蓝卡坞那么多剧组招工，我怎么偏偏挑了这个地方，唉，真倒霉……","id":72,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/38/Avg_avg_npc_1846_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#1$1","id":73},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影助理","text":"行了行了。无故翻倒的油漆桶，摄影棚外窜过的黑影，甚至连城际网络信号失灵，你都能怪到自己的运气上。","id":74,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#5$1","id":75},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影助理","text":"我倒觉得是我们走大运了！事故现场的一手资料能在娱乐周刊卖出一笔好价钱——","id":76,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/25/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#1$1","id":77},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影助理","text":"让开一点，我看不清谢莉遗体的细节了。","id":78,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1846_1#1$1","id":79},{"type":"dialogue","name":"倒霉的场工","text":"别看了……我们得去摄影棚帮忙了。","id":80,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c8/Avg_avg_npc_1846_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#5$1","id":81},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影助理","text":"你先去，霍汀。我得把这些都记下来！","id":82,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/25/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1846_1#1$1","id":83},{"type":"dialogue","name":"倒霉的场工","text":"……","id":84,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c8/Avg_avg_npc_1846_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":85},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":86},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":87},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":88},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#1$1","id":89},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_penrustle","id":90},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":91},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影助理","text":"……听阿布纳说，谢莉以前就神神道道的。难不成是道尔顿的死对她的冲击太大，所以自寻短见？","id":92,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#1$1","id":93},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影助理","text":"合理但略显无聊。","id":94,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#5$1","id":95},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影助理","text":"要是另有隐情……嘿嘿，那我上半年的房租都不用愁了，谁还要当整天举收音挑杆的人形支架啊！","id":96,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/25/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#6$1","id":97},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影助理","text":"嗯？","id":98,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#3$1","id":99},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影助理","text":"医疗小组不是说谢莉是被冻死的吗，那她的左手掌心怎么有那么多伤口？","id":100,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/70/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#2$1","id":101},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影助理","text":"嘶——看着真瘆人，难道是某种诅咒仪式……","id":102,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fb/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":103},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"并非诅咒，而是自我挣扎的痕迹。","id":104},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#1$1","id":105},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影助理","text":"……挣扎？","id":106,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影助理","text":"谢莉不是被精神压力击垮，自暴自弃才走进冷库的吗？难道真的有内幕——","id":107,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.2","xstrength":"20","ystrength":"20","vibrato":"20","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":108},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#3$1","id":109},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影助理","text":"卢西恩先生！你走路怎么没声啊！","id":110,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/70/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":111},{"type":"charslot","id":112},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":113},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":114},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"以疼痛抵抗幻觉，是我提出的建议。","id":115,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"谢莉小姐耳中回响着往事的遗音，但她仍想完成自己的工作，为电影带来圆满的结局。","id":116,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#2$1","id":117},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"她不会因绝望寻死，自伤的血痂就是最好的印证。","id":118,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#4$1","id":119},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"只是这次，疼痛没能引她逃脱幻境。","id":120,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#1$1","id":121},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影助理","text":"那个固执、神经质、难以沟通的谢莉听从了你提出的建议？不可置信……","id":122,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影助理","text":"你似乎很了解她啊，卢西恩先生。","id":123,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#1$1","id":124},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"谈不上。","id":125,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":126},{"type":"dialog","id":127},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":128},{"type":"charslot","id":129},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":130},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1839_1#1$1","id":131},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#3$1","id":132},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ec/Avg_bg_62_g9_outsidestudio_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":133},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":134},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$mist_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_dia_mist_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":135,"musicid":1},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":136},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"哪儿跟哪儿啊！","id":137,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/04/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"我求爱不成就杀了谢莉？亲爱的，你怎么会想到这种无稽之谈？","id":138,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/04/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1839_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":139},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛丽昂","text":"……","id":140,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_npc_1839_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":141},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"啊对了对了，小蒂比，你刚刚不是说谢莉是突然接到了一条讯息离开的吗？","id":142,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2e/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"我当时也注意到了她拿着终端。所以，一定是那个给她发消息的人诱杀了她，对吧？","id":143,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2e/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":144},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#10$1","id":145},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"难道那个人不是你？","id":146,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":147},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1839_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":148},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":149},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛丽昂","text":"我也需要一个解释，迈克尔。","id":150,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_npc_1839_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":151},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#4$1","id":152},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"虽然冷库的低温环境冻坏了终端，记录已经无法修复，但我们的终端都是剧组统一配备的，只有同组成员在联络名单里……","id":153,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6e/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":154},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#5$1","id":155},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"有完没完了，啊？蒂比大侦探？","id":156,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/47/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"难道就不能是格蕾塔女士，或者是米兰妮女士？","id":157,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/47/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"白天她打断了拍摄，这两位都很不高兴，说不定是想再敲打一下谢莉。","id":158,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/47/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":159},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#5$1","id":160},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"格蕾塔女士和谢莉小姐在工作时形影不离，多的是处理突发事件的机会。","id":161,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"米兰妮女士严格遵守片场的礼仪和规则，她尊重剧组安排的日程，不会打扰其他成员的休息。","id":162,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"从目前得知的情况而言，我们只知道，出事前她见过你。","id":163,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#5$1","id":164},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"嘿，我根本不知道谁给她发的消息，我只是恰巧在摄影棚撞上她而已！","id":165,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/47/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#5$1","id":166},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"那个时间点，你通常不是在自助酒吧跟美术组的姐姐喝酒，就是在玛丽昂的房间里。","id":167,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"夜晚对你来说是非常宝贵的时间，对吧？","id":168,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"迈克尔先生，你为什么会回到拍摄区？","id":169,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#1$1","id":170},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"啊，可爱的小鸟，你是因为不能跟我一起喝酒所以不高兴了是不是？","id":171,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/92/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"等你再长大一点，我们会有机会的——","id":172,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/92/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#6$1","id":173},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"你出于某种目的来到摄影棚。你遇见为了赴约离开道具间的谢莉。如果你真的只是安慰了她几句，为什么不肯正面回答我的所有问题？","id":174,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"谢莉的死，真的跟你没关系？","id":175,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#2$1","id":176},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"……","id":177,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"怎么，蒂比，在蓝卡坞兜兜转转体验各个工种——杂务、场工、置景、喷绘师……还不够满足你，现在又想当侦探了？","id":178,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"还是说一部恐怖电影就把谢莉变成你和莫伊拉的姐妹小团体的新成员了？","id":179,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#5$1","id":180},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"别装了。","id":181,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/47/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"工作的时候，她没少对着你乱涂乱画的阴森背景板破口大骂，你们根本不熟，干嘛现在咬着我不放？","id":182,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/47/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"所有意外背后都有真凶？电影看多了吧！","id":183,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/47/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#9$1","id":184},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"……认识谢莉小姐的两个月里，她很少对剧组成员微笑，也很少赞美别人。","id":185,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/97/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"她指责我的次数最多，为了改出我们都能接受的背景绘图，我加班了很多次。","id":186,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/97/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"但我知道她检查每天的拍摄素材的时候，会展露欣喜的神情；那些异想天开的背景板里致敬了多少小众影片，只有她能看出来。","id":187,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/97/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"如果她真的已经非常非常痛苦想要解脱……我会尊重她的决定。","id":188,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/97/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#7$1","id":189},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"但如果有人在控制她的情绪，摧残她的心智，剥夺她继续热爱电影的权利，我无法原谅！","id":190,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#3$1","id":191},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"……","id":192,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/04/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#2$1","id":193},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"我跟谢莉确实是偶遇。昨天晚上我去摄影棚……是为了找人。","id":194,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#6$1","id":195},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"找人？谁能为你作证！","id":196,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#4$1","id":197},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"我……","id":198,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e7/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":199},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"我。","id":200},{"type":"dialog","id":201},{"type":"charslot","id":202},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":203},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":204},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"……","id":205,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#8$1","id":206},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"莫丽？","id":207,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d8/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#1$1","id":208},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"昨天晚上，迈克尔先生是来找我的。","id":209,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":210},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":211},{"type":"charslot","id":212},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":213},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d0/Avg_bg_bg_warehouse.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":214},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":215},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":216},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#1$1","id":217},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影助理","text":"你跟谢莉小姐走得很近？","id":218,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#1$1","id":219},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"只是对她的痛苦感同身受。","id":220,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"她有必须保持清醒的理由，我也是。","id":221,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#6$1","id":222},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影助理","text":"（小声）神秘诅咒，还是因爱生恨……哪种方向的八卦更受读者欢迎呢……","id":223,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#1$1","id":224},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影助理","text":"咳，那昨天晚上你在哪里？","id":225,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#1$1","id":226},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"二楼办公室。","id":227,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#1$1","id":228},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影助理","text":"我记得那间办公室是谢莉和格蕾塔存放重要文件的地方，你去那里做什么？","id":229,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#1$1","id":230},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"解谜。","id":231,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#1$1","id":232},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影助理","text":"谁能替你作证？","id":233,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#1$1","id":234},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"Miss.Christine。","id":235,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#6$1","id":236},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影助理","text":"哈，你要我相信跟在你身边的那只小怪物？她都不会开口说话！","id":237,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#7$1","id":238},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"……","id":239,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/df/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#5$1","id":240},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影助理","text":"卢西恩先生，别露出这种不悦的表情嘛……","id":241,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/25/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影助理","text":"我看过你那天和道尔顿对戏，知道你是一名多么出色的演员……伪装坦诚，对你来说不是难事。","id":242,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/25/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#1$1","id":243},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影助理","text":"说实在的，我个人一点也不关心谢莉因何而死，也就是说，即使她的死真和你有关，我也绝对不会向警方举报。","id":244,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影助理","text":"甚至，如果你登上不入流的八卦小报，警察还会降低对你的怀疑度——没人相信花边新闻说的是真的，只是看个乐子。","id":245,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影助理","text":"所以请你再配合我一下——你在办公室解的谜究竟是什么？难道是在策划如何让谢莉掉入陷阱？","id":246,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#2$1","id":247},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"你丝毫不惧移动地块上正发生谋杀？","id":248,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#2$1","id":249},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影助理","text":"唉，剧组里的恩怨情仇数不胜数……不然我靠什么吃饭，做摄影助理吗？","id":250,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fb/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#2$1","id":251},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"哪怕谜题的答案会威胁到所有人的生命？","id":252,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#1$1","id":253},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影助理","text":"哈！夸大其词。","id":254,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#1$1","id":255},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"那请你保守秘密……","id":256,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#5$1","id":257},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影助理","text":"当然！我才不会让别人分我的独家稿费呢！","id":258,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/25/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":259},{"type":"text","text":"卢西恩凑近摄影助理的耳朵，轻柔地吐露被隐瞒的真相。","id":260},{"type":"text","text":"摄影助理的眼神从兴奋转为惊恐。","id":261},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.2","xstrength":"20","ystrength":"20","vibrato":"20","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":262},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#3$1","id":263},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影助理","text":"什么！","id":264,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/70/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":265},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_pendrop","id":266},{"type":"text","text":"八卦专用记事本和笔掉落在地，丰蹄爆发出的惊呼响彻整个仓库。","id":267},{"type":"text","text":"仍在清理现场的剧组成员不满地看向卢西恩和摄影助理，下一秒，一条骇人听闻的讯息传入每个人的耳中。","id":268},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.4","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":269},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#3$1","id":270},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影助理","text":"你是说这个地块很有可能即将遭遇天灾？！","id":271,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/70/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":272},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":273},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":274},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":275},{"type":"image","id":276},{"type":"charslot","id":277}],"characters":["蒂比","迈克尔","玛丽昂","摄影助理","倒霉的场工","？？？","卢西恩","莫伊拉"]}